thubusercontent.com/u/32887778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowyih","html_url":"https://github.com/meowyih","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowyih/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowyih/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowyih/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowyih/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowyih/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowyih/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowyih/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowyih/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/meowyih/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T16:10:55Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T16:13:08Z","body":"> [@meowyih](https://github.com/meowyih) have you been able to reproduce this issue?\n\nYes, the test project is attached.\n\n[test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23726924/test.zip)\n\nWhen you open the project in Godot 4.5.1, you should see \"ERROR: Animation 'new_animation' does not exist\" message. And when execute this project, there will always be \"get_frame_count: Animation 'new_animation' doesn't exist.\" error in Error tab.\n\nHere is how to create that project in Godot:\n\n1. Create a new project.\n2. Create a new scene using AnimatedSprite3D type. (Click +Other Node -> AnimatedSprite3D)\n3. Create a new SpriteFrame resource with default name \"new_sprite_frames.tres\" in FileSystem and in the SpriteFrame editor window, create a new animation with default name \"new_animation\" under default animation.\n5. In AnimatedSprite3D's inspector window, drag \"new_sprite_frames.tres\" to Sprite Frames property and \"new_animation\" to Animation property. (make sure you drag the tres file directly from resource window, instead of create another new one in Inspector)\n6. Run the project to save the current scene information in to \"animated_sprite_3d.tscn\"\n\n*** new step ***\n\n7. create another scene by click the + nect to \"animated_sprite_3d\" tab on top of the editor.\n8. In the new scene, click \"3D Scene\" as the root node\n9. Save this new scene as node3d_tscn\n10. In this new scene, click \"Instantiate Child Scene\" and select \"animated_sprite_3d.tscn\n11. Run the project to save all scene information\n12. Stop the running window\n13. Switch to animated_sprite3d scene tab, click new_sprite_frames.tres and delete the \"new_animation\" in SpriteFrame editor window.\n14. Save & Quit the project without running the project third time.\n\n****\n\n15. Before launch Godot again, you can check in \"animated_sprite_3d.tscn\" there is a [animation = &“new_animation”]. But we already deleted it in step 6.\n16. Because of (15), the non-existing animation name will be there forever. Everytime user run the project will get the \"ERROR: Animation 'new_animation' doesn't exist.\" error message.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3571581823/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3571589629","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112442#issuecomment-3571589629","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112442","id":3571589629,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7U4iH9","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com